          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Bál slahhángw geera bar mibaá nee tsiyáhh deelór ur ar Pasaáka ka tlehhá'. Ar afiqoomoó deelo faanqw mikaátér taa sluuftisiiká ka /agá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baalaarihe geeraharusmo awu wák gu ilahhooár wa haniis as tlakweemaawós nee as tlakweemaá muu sleémeero oo Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuúqo baalaaro baraá deeloorí faanqwe inós awe faanqw ar batláy gari ilahhooár da/tá wa haniis dír AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, nee gwaandaawér faanqw ar xaslxaansli wasl, kin adoodá' aldaa/. Slamí gurta gun ilahhooár wa haniis umuú baalaaro as tlakweema hingeesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy ilahhooár puurú ar kílo mibaangw gay haniis as umuúqo awu, nee kílo mibaangw as umuúqo gwaanduuwo nee liíta tám ar di/i as umuúqo kílo mibaangw ar puurú.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
