          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Bál slahhángw faanqw bar mibaá nee kooán deeloodá' ur, geeraharusmo muruú ilahhooa gu haniis as ilahhooár tlakweema hingeesa, nee ilahhooár da/a, nee ilahhooár balaangw nee ilahhooár di/i.»",
          "type": "text",
